      "section_id": "S3_HUMAN_RISK",
      "voiceover_text": "But the arrival of AI in Deep Fake does not resolve the underlying tensions. It often sharpens them — exposing who has voice, who has access, and who bears the risks. And deep fakes and it's it's not until really fairly recently that there's been some attention say oh this is actually problematic whereas for at least 10 years we've had you know women were almost sort of the the canary in the coal mine the first victims of this we've seen we've seen deep fake material being used in terms of domestic violence."
