      "created_at": "2026-06-24T13:44:16.703316",
      "section_id": "S4_PUBLIC_RISK",
      "voiceover_text": "Across these conversations, Deep Fake is not a distant aspiration. It is a field in motion — with real evidence, real failure, and real possibilities for change. Generated content and fake news include text video and photo as well as imitation of style and voices of author. For example, disinformation campaign used video with fake voices of famous TV host who emotionally talk about supposed message attack. However, another not less important problem is connected with disinformation."
    },
