      "size_bytes": 196416,
      "created_at": "2026-06-24T13:44:20.222434",
      "section_id": "S5_RESPONSE",
      "voiceover_text": "The measure of AI will not be the speed of its systems, but whether the people it touches are better served, better heard, and more free. Generative artificial intelligence helps us to do the same. In that sense, it is like old wine in a new bottle except that the scale and scope of its impact are unprecedented. For example, include fake video messages from the president of Ukraine Volodymyr Zelensky, supposedly calling on military personnel to surrender or messages from the commander in chief of the Ukrainian armed forces."
    },
